---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web -> native; the web source is THE spec)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  data:   DigestMetrics slice {avgEfficiency, prevAvgEfficiency, totalDuration,
          totalDrives, topDrive} + DailyDistanceEntry[] (types.ts, built by
          useWeeklyDigest) -> DrivingDigestDTO + DrivingDailyDistance/DrivingTopDrive
          (DrivingSection.Models.swift). Props in web -> pushed by a P1/S8
          DrivingSectionSource snapshot (no view HTTP).
  units:  web renders RAW km / Wh·km / minutes (labels literally "(km)", "Wh/km",
          "min"); NO useUnits() conversion here -> native reproduces km/Wh·km/min
          verbatim (adding a unit boundary would diverge from the spec).
  shell:  <FadeIn delay={0.1}> + <GlassPanel space-y-6 p-6>  -> TSFadeIn(delay:0.1)
          + tokenized glass card (Color.TS.surface + TSRadius.lg + Color.TS.border).
  title:  t('analytics.weeklyDigest.drivingSection','Driving') + lucide <Car/> ->
          DrivingSectionStrings key + SF "car.fill" header.
  chart:  Recharts <BarChart data={dailyDistanceData}> one <Bar dataKey="distance"
          fill={CHART_COLORS[0]} radius=[4,4,0,0]>, YAxis fmtInt, <Tooltip
          ChartTooltip> -> Swift Charts Chart{ BarMark }.foregroundStyle(
          TSChartPalette.color(at:0)).cornerRadius(4), YAxis fmtInt, selection
          tooltip via .chartXSelection RuleMark annotation (DrivingSection.Chart.swift).
  empty1: dailyDistanceData.length>0 ? chart : <EmptyState noDailyDistance> ->
          bars.isEmpty ? ContentUnavailableView(noDailyDistance) : chart.
  stats:  4x <MiniStat> -> DrivingStatsGrid of DrivingStatTile (web MiniStat):
            Avg Efficiency `${fmtNumber(avgEfficiency,1)} Wh/km`  (SF chart.bar.fill)
            Total Driving Time `${fmtInt(floor(d/60))}h ${fmtInt(d%60)}m` (SF clock.fill)
            Efficiency Change prevAvg>0 ? `${fmtNumber(pctChange,1)}%` : '—',
              icon avg<=prev ? TrendingDown(emerald) : TrendingUp(red)
              -> trend .down/.positive vs .up/.negative (lower-is-better)
            Drives `fmtInt(totalDrives)`                          (SF waveform.path.ecg)
  top:    metrics.topDrive ? <Badge success>Top Drive</Badge> + Date/Distance/
          Duration/Efficiency grid : <EmptyState noTopDrive> -> DrivingTopDrivePanel
          (emerald badge + labelled grid) vs ContentUnavailableView(noTopDrive).
          formatDate(start_date) -> DrivingFormat.date (medium "Apr 4, 2026", '—' fallback).
  i18n:   every web t(key,default) + the inline unit glyphs resolved through the
          DrivingSectionStrings facade (table "DrivingSection"); shipped as the
          per-surface DrivingSection.strings (the shared Localizable.xcstrings is
          parallel-unsafe and out of scope).

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  -> DrivingSectionLoading (TSSkeleton chart + 4 stat + top-drive blocks; reduce-motion safe)
  content  -> chart(or inner empty) + 4 stats + top-drive(or inner empty)
  empty    -> DrivingSectionEmpty (ContentUnavailableView; resolved-but-no-digest)
  error    -> DrivingSectionErrorView (QueryError-equiv, Retry -> model.refresh())
  stale    -> freshness chip (Stale) + connectivity banner + one guarded auto-refresh
  offline  -> freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps cached content, no refetch
  + inner empties: noDailyDistance (chart) and noTopDrive (top-drive card).
a11y: section summary (title + each stat), chart summary (title + day count +
  total km), per-bar VoiceOver value, stat/top-drive combined labels, reduce-motion
  animation gate, Dynamic Type via system fonts/tokens.
telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened(surface:"DrivingSection") emitted once on appear.

